# sidebar-scroll-plane (fix-viewer-size phase 2): a wheel over the plane at
# 1024 x 640. The camera zooms (the plane's own wheel) and the sidebar's
# scroll stays 0: the wheel belongs to the plane, not to the sidebar.
size 1024 640
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
move 700 300
wheel 0 100
wait 1500
shot sidebar-scroll-plane
